- **kilix-license owns:**
  - licence records, with text stored by digest;
  - the verbatim first-use screen, covering binding conditions (OD-AG, OD-AH), advisories (OD-AD,
    OD-AF) and component exceptions;
  - agreement, and digest-bound receipts (OD-M in its OD-AI form);
  - the covers/require check, scoped to the binding.

